        'sections' => [
            [
                'label' => 'Verse 1',
                'kind' => 'verse',
                'num' => 1,
                'lines' => [
                    'The God of Abraham praise, who reigns enthroned above —',
                    'Ancient of everlasting days and God of love.',
                    'Jehovah, great I AM, by earth and heaven confessed,',
                    'I bow and bless the sacred name forever blessed.',
                ],
            ],
            [
                'label' => 'Verse 2',
                'kind' => 'verse',
                'num' => 2,
                'lines' => [
                    'The God of Abr\'ham praise, at Whose supreme command From earth I',
                    'rise and seek the joys at His right hand;',
                    'I all on earth forsake, its wisdom, fame, and pow\'r;',
                    'And Him my only Portion make, my Shield and Tow\'r.',
                ],
            ],
            [
                'label' => 'Verse 3',
                'kind' => 'verse',
                'num' => 3,
                'lines' => [
                    'The God of Abr\'ham praise, Whose all sufficient grace Shall guide me all',
                    'my happy days, in all my ways. He calls',
                    'a worm His friend, He calls Himself my God! And',
                    'He shall save me to the end, thro\' Jesus\' blood.',
                ],
            ],
            [
                'label' => 'Verse 4',
                'kind' => 'verse',
                'num' => 4,
                'lines' => [
                    'He by Himself has sworn; I on His oath depend, I',
                    'shall, on eagle wings upborne, to Heav\'n ascend.',
                    'I shall behold His face; I shall His pow\'r',
                    'adore, And sing the wonders of His grace forevermore.',
                ],
            ],
            [
                'label' => 'Verse 5',
                'kind' => 'verse',
                'num' => 5,
                'lines' => [
                    'Tho\' nature\'s strength decay, and earth and hell withstand, To Canaan\'s',
                    'bounds I urge my way, at His command.',
                    'The wat\'ry deep I pass, with Jesus in my',
                    'view; And thro\' the howling wilderness my way pursue.',
                ],
            ],
        ],
